I can’t run the API call for you, but the snippet above will let you do it locally. Once you run it, you’ll see that the coordinates you supplied correspond to the address “1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043, USA” (the Googleplex). If you run into any errors or need help interpreting the response, feel free to paste the JSON here and I’ll help you parse it!
